      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHINELIKETHESUN (3) after racing five-back on the fence at the bell fought on well to finish second as the $2.50 favourite last time out, beaten 2.25 metres, in a far better performance at Melton over 1720m. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Leading hope in this comparable race. CLASSIC FAIR (9) found form and finished second two runs ago over 2160m at this track, then came back to earth when he broke and finished a distant fourth over 2160m at Echuca. Only needs to get things right to be in contention. ALDEBARAN MISTIQUE (4) did a good job to finish in the minor placings two runs back then her luck changed last time when she broke and finished a long way back in eighth over 1755m at Echuca. Has the benefit of a good draw. Can't make any mistakes against this field but she is right in the mix. MOONSHINE LOUIE (2) is consistent draws to be competitive again.",
